Task 1: Create a Static Inventory File in YAML
Subtask 1.1: Understanding Inventory Basics
Static inventories are manually created files that define which hosts Ansible should manage. They can be written in INI format or YAML format.

Key Concepts:

Hosts: Individual servers that Ansible manages
Groups: Collections of hosts that share common characteristics
Variables: Configuration data that can be applied to hosts or groups
